# 30-Agent MCP tools

This workspace exposes a local MCP server named `30agents` (stdio bridge → `http://127.0.0.1:8000`).

## When to use

Prefer these MCP tools over reinventing pipelines:

- General multi-agent work → `agent_chat`
- Lead discovery / cold email → `outreach_*` or `run_squad` with `squad_name=outreach`
- SEO / backlinks / redesign → `seo_*`, `design_concept`, or `run_squad` with `squad_name=seo`
- Grouped specialists → `list_squads` then `run_squad` (analytics, content, code, vision)
- Connectivity check → `health_check` first if tools fail

## Prerequisites

The FastAPI server must be running:

```bash
python main.py serve
# or: ./run.sh --no-tmux
```

`outreach_send` and `outreach_pipeline` default to `dry_run=true` — only set `dry_run=false` when the user explicitly asks to send real email.
